  "details": "1. Open quick menu, select \"here\" tab.\n\n2. Select someone in the instance.\n\n3. Click \"match eye height\".  It will not work having been selected from there.\n\nThis is a bit of a problem.  There are times where it is very difficult to select an individual by hand due to either the size/location of their pill or their physical location when there's a lot of people in the immediate area.  Also the button's presence when selecting someone that way implies that it should work, but does not currently, and therefore an unintended bug.",
